 G('take something into consideration',['Forma','Exemplo'],[['take + objeto + into consideration','The council **takes costs into consideration**.'],['take into consideration + objeto longo','**Take into consideration** all the evidence.'],['passiva: be taken into consideration','Bills **must be taken into consideration**.'],['take … into account','Residents’ views must be **taken into account**.'],['gerúndio','**Taking** only income **into consideration** is unfair.']],'Se o objeto é curto, ele vem **entre** *take* e *into consideration*; se é longo, vem **depois**.','Prefira *take into account* em textos mais curtos; *take into consideration* soa um pouco mais formal.'),
