 [('Ask someone to consider something.','Peça.','Please take our costs into consideration.'),('Say what must be considered.','Diga.','Energy bills must be taken into account.'),('Explain a risk of ignoring data.','Explique.','Taking only average income into consideration hides poorer families.')],
